A program analysis tool for verifying compliance with laws and policies

Usage: vampiro [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  check     Analyze source files for composition, modularity, and robustness breaks
  init      Initialize project scaffolding for vampiro
  init-ci   Generate CI workflow configuration
  prove     Reserved for proof commands
  doctor    Run diagnostic checks on the project
  feedback  Report feedback — file a bug or feature request
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --completions <SHELL>  Print shell completion script and exit [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
